 licenses required for real estate contribution activities. It also facilitates the acceptance of applications for the qualification and classification of real estate developers, and ensures the completion of all licensing and qualification processes electronically.\"","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"hidePageFromNavigation","path":"Property/hidePageFromNavigation","oldValue":"null","newValue":"\"0\"","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"keywords","path":"Property/keywords","oldValue":"null","newValue":"\"[\\n  \\\"المساهمات\\\",\\n  \\\"العقارية\\\",\\n  \\\"المساهمات العقارية\\\",\\n  \\\"Rega\\\",\\n  \\\"الخدمات الالكترونية\\\",\\n  \\\"تراخيص\\\",\\n  \\\"مساهمات\\\"\\n]\"","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"pageName","path":"Property/pageName","oldValue":"null","newValue":"\"المساهمات العقارية\"","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"pageName","path":"Property/pageName","oldValue":"null","newValue":"\"Real Estate Contributions\"","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"pageTitle","path":"Property/pageTitle","oldValue":"null","newValue":"\"المساهمات العقارية \"","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"pageTitle","path":"Property/pageTitle","oldValue":"null","newValue":"\"Real Estate Contributions\"","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"serviceBrief","path":"Property/serviceBrief","oldValue":"null","newValue":"\"{\\\"markup\\\":\\\"<p style=\\\\\\\"text-align: center; line-height: 95%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 12.0pt 0cm 12.0pt 0cm;\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\" align=\\\\\\\"center\\\\\\\">منصة المساهمات العقارية هي المنصة الإلكترونية الرسمية لتلقي طلبات إصدار التراخيص اللازمة لممارسة نشاط المساهمات العقارية وتعديلها وإلغائها، واستقبال طلبات تأهيل وتصنيف المطورين العقاريين، وإتمام كافة إجراءات الترخيص والتأهيل بشكل إلكتروني.</p>\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\"text-align: center; line-height: 95%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 12.0pt 0cm 12.0pt 0cm;\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\" align=\\\\\\\"center\\\\\\\">&nbsp;</p>\\\",\\\"blocks\\\":{\\\"contentData\\\":[],\\\"settingsData\\\":[]}}\"","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"serviceBrief","path":"Property/serviceBrief","oldValue":"null","newValue":"\"{\\\"markup\\\":\\\"<p>The Real Estate Contributions Platform is the official electronic platform designated for the submission of applications to issue, amend, and cancel licenses required for real estate contribution activities. It also facilitates the acceptance of applications for the qualification and classification of real estate developers, and ensures the completion of all licensing and qualification processes electronically.</p>\\\",\\\"blocks\\\":{\\\"contentData\\\":[],\\\"settingsData\\\":[]}}\"","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"serviceFeature","path":"Property/serviceFeature","oldValue":"null","newValue":"\"[{\\\"key\\\":\\\"000c4341-21eb-4ddc-aa31-662766fc9b42\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Item 1\\\",\\\"ncContentTypeAlias\\\":\\\"servicesFeatures\\\",\\\"PropType\\\":null,\\\"icon\\\":\\\"umb://media/a0df66c37ac6423084eb3fe30c460542\\\",\\\"featureTabTitle\\\":\\\"عن الخدمة\\\",\\\"featureBrief\\\":{\\\"markup\\\":\\\"<p style=\\\\\\\"text-align: right; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\">منصة المساهمات العقارية هي المنصة الإلكترونية الرسمية لتلقي طلبات إصدار التراخيص اللازمة لممارسة نشاط المساهمات العقارية وتعديلها وإلغائها، واستقبال طلبات تأهيل وتصنيف المطورين العقاريين، وإتمام كافة إجراءات الترخيص والتأهيل بشكل إلكتروني.</p>\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\"text-align: right; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\"><a rel=\\\\\\\"noopener\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"/media/kwrbhkn2/نظام-المساهمات-العقارية.pdf#https://rega.gov.sa/media/kwrbhkn2/نظام-المساهمات-العقارية.pdf\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\" title=\\\\\\\"https://rega.gov.sa/media/kwrbhkn2/نظام-المساهمات-العقارية.pdf\\\\\\\" data-anchor=\\\\\\\"#https://rega.gov.sa/media/kwrbhkn2/نظام-المساهمات-العقارية.pdf\\\\\\\">نظام المساهمات العقارية </a></p>\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\"text-align: right; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\"><a rel=\\\\\\\"noopener\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"/{localLink:umb://media/d1a990f293224fb893216d0576c151e9}\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\" title=\\\\\\\"Mosahamat\\\\\\\">اللائحة التنفيذية لنظام المساهمات العقارية</a></p>\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\"text-align: right; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\"><a rel=\\\\\\\"noopener\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"/media/snnhcgct/ضوابط-حساب-الضمان-للمساهمات-العقارية.pdf#https://rega.gov.sa/media/snnhcgct/ضوابط-حساب-الضمان-للمساهمات-العقارية.pdf\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\" title=\\\\\\\"https://rega.gov.sa/media/snnhcgct/ضوابط-حساب-الضمان-للمساهمات-العقارية.pdf\\\\\\\" data-anchor=\\\\\\\"#https://rega.gov.sa/media/snnhcgct/ضوابط-حساب-الضمان-للمساهمات-العقارية.pdf\\\\\\\">ضوابط حساب الضمان للمساهمين العقاريين</a></p>\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\"text-align: right; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\"><a rel=\\\\\\\"noopener\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"/media/i3upagav/تعليمات-طرح-شهادات-المساهمات-العقارية.pdf#https://rega.gov.sa/media/i3upagav/تعليمات-طرح-شهادات-المساهمات-العقارية.pdf\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\" title=\\\\\\\"https://rega.gov.sa/media/i3upagav/تعليمات-طرح-شهادات-المساهمات-العقارية.pdf\\\\\\\" data-anchor=\\\\\\\"#https://rega.gov.sa/media/i3upagav/تعليمات-طرح-شهادات-المساهمات-العقارية.pdf\\\\\\\">تعليمات طرح شهادات المساهمات العقارية</a></p>\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\"text-align: right; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\"><a rel=\\\\\\\"noopener\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"/media/5lrntbnx/instructions-on-the-offering-of-real-estate-contrbutions-certific