\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">3- </span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">تحديد نوع التصرف بالعقار محل المزاد العقاري.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">4-</span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">الإفصاح عن الحقوق العينية المرتبطة بالعقار. </span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">5- </span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">النزاعات القائمة بشأن العقار -إن وجدت-. </span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">6-</span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">الرهن أو القيد المؤثر في الانتفاع من العقار -إن وجد-. </span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">7- </span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">الحقوق والالتزامات على العقار غير الموثقة في وثيقة العقار -إن وجدت-.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">8- </span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">الخدمات المتعلقة بالعقار -إن وجدت-.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">9-</span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">المعلومات التي قد تؤثر في قيمة العقار –إن وجدت-.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">10- </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">رابط النقل المرئي المباشر للمزادات –إن وجد-.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">11- </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">البيانات الواردة في الفقرة رقم (6) من المادة (السادسة) من هذه اللائحة.</span></p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":null},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/6f93e85909ce4e5faefee78e8cc05eb8\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"المادة التاسعة\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .25in 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">1- </span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">يتولى مدير المزاد العقاري إدارة المزايدة السعرية بين المتنافسين، </span>ويبدأ المزاد العقاري ‌<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">وفقاً لقيمة بدء المزاد العقاري المحددة في عقد الوساطة، ويجوز بدء المزاد بغير تلك القيمة حال إقرار المالك - أو من يمثله نظاماً –كتابة على ذلك.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .25in 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">2- </span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">إذا قدم أحد المتنافسين أعلى عطاء ولم يقم أحدٌ بالمزايدة عليه، -وفق المدة الزمنية المحددة في عقد الوساطة-، فيجوز لمدير المزاد العقاري تمديدها لمدة مماثلة مرة واحدة</span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .25in 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">3- </span></span>إذا لم يصل<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> المزاد العقاري للقيمة المتفق عليها لقبول البيع في عقد الوساطة، فيتم التعامل معها بأحد الأحوال التالية:</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 45.0pt 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">أ‌- </span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">إقرار المالك - أو من يمثله نظاماً - كتابة على قبول الترسية والتصرف في العقار بالسعر الذي وصلت له المزايدة.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 45.0pt 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">ب‌-<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> &nbsp;</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">إنهاء المزايدة في حال عدم الإقرار من المالك - أو من يمثله نظاماً -، وتحرير محضر بذلك.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .25in 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">4- </span></span>يتم ترسية<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> المزاد العقاري على المتنافس الذي قدم أعلى عطاء ولم يقم أحد بالمزايدة عليه، وانتهاء المدة المحددة للمزايدة، وفق الحالات التالية:</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 45.0pt 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">أ‌-<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">بلوغ المزايدة أو تجاوزها للقيمة المحددة لقبول الترسية والتصرف في العقار المنصوص عليها في عقد الوساطة.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 45.0pt 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">ب‌- </span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">عدم بلوغ المزايدة للقيمة المحددة لقبول الترسية والتصرف في العقار المنصوص عليها في عقد الوساطة، وإقرار المالك -أو من يمثله نظاماً- كتابة على قبول الترسية والتصرف في العقار، وفقا للفقرة (3/أ) من هذه المادة.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .25in 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">5- </span></span>تستكمل<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> إجراءات التصرف في العقار، وحجز مبلغ العربون وفقا للمدة المحددة لتسلم وتسليم الثمن في عقد الوساطة.</span></p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":null},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/f7a5508aab11429fb547f8534fbba896\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"المادة العاشرة\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .25in 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">1-<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> </span></span></span>يجب على<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> المرخص له إقفال المزاد العقاري في المنصة الإلكترونية بعد الانتهاء من إقامته خلال مدة لا تزيد على (خمسة) أيام عمل</span>.</p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .25in 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">2- </span></span>يعيد المرخص<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> له جميع المبالغ المالية للمتنافسين المستلمة من قبله في المزاد العقاري - عدا من رسا عليه المزاد العقاري - خلال مدة لا تتجاوز (ثلاثة) أيام عمل من تاريخ الانتهاء من إقامته. </span></p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":null},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/740b50bfe26f42e9b0d6e976ad22a72a\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"المادة الحادية عشرة\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">تسري أحكام هذه اللائحة على كافة المزادات العقارية في المملكة، ومنها المزادات العقارية القضائية وما في حكمها في حدود ما لم يرد فيه نص خاص لتنظيمها.</span></p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":null},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/6a8ca639b080441a8d687f531c5bf30f\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"المادة الثانية عشرة\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">تُنشر هذه اللائحة في الجريدة الرسمية، ويُعمل بها من تاريخ نشرها.</span></p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":null},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/e6aa439b118347978c8cc28399260ba7\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"أحكام الترخيص\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":null},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/774dc0d992de4eb0aa9558a78f556fb4\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"التزامات المرخص له\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":null},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/4fa171b16b7e4ef58d430095c098badb\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"المنصة الإلكترونية\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":null},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/3b5fd9c8f8054d9fa92436c3a5566e89\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"أحكام إقامة المزاد العقاري\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":null},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/31e11ad366984ce5ac5a900f7a54eec9\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"أحكام ختامية\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":null}],\\\"settingsData\\\":[]}\"","newValue":"\"{\\\"layout\\\":{\\\"Umbraco.BlockList\\\":[{\\\"contentUdi\\\":\\\"umb://element/c05cac4c65834858b70131a5e1470e98\\\"},{\\\"contentUdi\\\":\\\"umb://element/e6aa439b118347978c8cc28399260ba7\\\"},{\\\"contentUdi\\\":\\\"umb://element/79e3a0c9cacb49daabd0ed32c54f5a5b\\\"},{\\\"contentUdi\\\":\\\"umb://element/774dc0d992de4eb0aa9558a78f556fb4\\\"},{\\\"contentUdi\\\":\\\"umb://element/852a7f732dc6481ab3ed9572dc9c496e\\\"},{\\\"contentUdi\\\":\\\"umb://element/ec2d3d4785ac416c91777b8a1bb241a8\\\"},{\\\"contentUdi\\\":\\\"umb://element/4fa171b16b7e4ef58d430095c098badb\\\"},{\\\"contentUdi\\\":\\\"umb://element/b6e9fa213c2b47a3bce8ce4c654b2142\\\"},{\\\"contentUdi\\\":\\\"umb://element/a1a8f4a3aa4b4898b49eed440a1ceebd\\\"},{\\\"contentUdi\\\":\\\"umb://element/24cf183cb8374c6f83981476a4d6388d\\\"},{\\\"contentUdi\\\":\\\"umb://element/3b5fd9c8f8054d9fa92436c3a5566e89\\\"},{\\\"contentUdi\\\":\\\"umb://element/91707b4583e8497abc7232dabd527ae1\\\"},{\\\"contentUdi\\\":\\\"umb://element/6f93e85909ce4e5faefee78e8cc05eb8\\\"},{\\\"contentUdi\\\":\\\"umb://element/f7a5508aab11429fb547f8534fbba896\\\"},{\\\"contentUdi\\\":\\\"umb://element/31e11ad366984ce5ac5a900f7a54eec9\\\"},{\\\"contentUdi\\\":\\\"umb://element/740b50bfe26f42e9b0d6e976ad22a72a\\\"},{\\\"contentUdi\\\":\\\"umb://element/6a8ca639b080441a8d687f531c5bf30f\\\"}]},\\\"contentData\\\":[{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/c05cac4c65834858b70131a5e1470e98\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"المادة الأولى\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .25in 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">1-<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">يكون للألفاظ والمصطلحات الواردة في هذه اللائحة المعاني المُبينة أمام كل منها في المادة (الأولى) من نظام الوساطة العقارية الصادر بالمرسوم الملكي رقم: (م/130) في 30/11/1443هـ، ولائحته التنفيذية ما لم يقتض السياق خلاف ذلك.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .25in 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">2-<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">يُقصد بالألفاظ والمصطلحات التالية -أينما وردت- في هذه اللائحة المعاني المُبينة أمام كل منها، ما لم يقتض السياق خلاف ذلك: </span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .25in 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><strong>المزاد العقاري: </strong><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">المزايدة العلنية على عقار من أجل بيعه أو بيع منفعته أو تأجيره؛ للوصول بثمنه إلى أعلى قدر ويشمل ذلك المزادات الإلكترونية</span><span>.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .25in 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><strong>المالك: </strong><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">شخص طبيعي أو اعتباري مالك للأصل أو المنفعة أو من يمثلهما نظاماً، المتعاقد مع الوسيط العقاري لإقامة المزاد العقاري.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .25in 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><strong>المُقٍيم المعتمد: </strong><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">الشخص المرخص له بمزاولة مهنة التقييم العقاري وفق نظام المقيمين المعتمدين.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .25in 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><strong>المرخص له:</strong><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> شخص اعتباري مرخص له بممارسة خدمة المزادات العقارية. </span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-right: .25in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><strong>مدير المزاد العقاري:</strong> </span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">شخص طبيعي مؤهل وتابع للمنشأة المرخصة مخول بالقيام بإدارة كافة أعمال المزاد العقاري لصالح المرخص له.</span></p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":\\\"0\\\"},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/79e3a0c9cacb49daabd0ed32c54f5a5b\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"المادة الثانية\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">يشترط للترخيص لممارسة خدمة المزادات العقارية - إضافة للاشتراطات الواردة في اللائحة التنفيذية لنظام الوساطة العقارية - للمنشآت التي تقدمها من خلال الوسائل الإلكترونية الآتي:</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">1- </span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">ربط منصة المزاد العقاري الإلكتروني الخاصة بالمرخص له، بالمنصة الإلكترونية للهيئة.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">2-</span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">التعهد بضمان سلامة العمليات التي تتم في منصة المرخص له، وإيقاف أو إعادة المزاد العقاري في الصفقات التي يشوبها أخطاء تقنية أو مخالفات، بما يضمن حماية تنافسية العرض والطلب. </span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">3-</span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">التعهد بنشر كافة بيانات المزادات العقارية المقامة على منصة المرخص له في المنصة الإلكترونية للهيئة. </span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">4-</span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">الحصول على كافة التراخيص النظامية اللازمة لممارسة النشاط، من الجهات ذات العلاقة.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">5-</span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">ربط المنصة الإلكترونية مع منصة النفاذ الوطني، ودخول المستفيدين للوسيلة الإلكترونية عن طريقه.</span></p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":null},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/852a7f732dc6481ab3ed9572dc9c496e\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"المادة الثالثة\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">يجب على المرخص له بممارسة المزادات العقارية، الالتزام بما يأتي:&nbsp;</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">1-</span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">التحلي بالنزاهة والإخلاص، والتعامل بحياد وعدل، وعدم التأثير على المنافسة العادلة بأي شكل.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">2-</span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">بذل العناية المهنية بحرص وإخلاص لتحقيق أفضل الأسعار.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">3-</span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">حفظ جميع نشرات المزادات العقارية وسجلاتها، </span>وتسجيل وقائع المزادات المرئية،<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> والمستندات والبيانات لجميع تعاملاته لمدة (خمس) سنوات من تاريخ انتهاء المزاد العقاري.<strong><u>&nbsp;</u></strong></span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">4-</span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">إقامة المزاد العقاري خلال مدة سريان عقد الوساطة.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">5-</span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">الحصول على الموافقات اللازمة من الجهات ذات الاختصاص في إقامة المزاد العقاري.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">6- </span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">ممارسة الخدمة من قبل الأفراد المؤهلين التابعين للمرخص له والمسجلين لدى الهيئة.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">7- </span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">الالتزام بما تقضي به الأنظمة والتعليمات من الجهات ذات الاختصاص في ممارسة المزادات العقارية.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">8- </span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">الإعلان عن نشرة المزاد العقاري قبل (خمسة) أيام -بحد أدنى- من تاريخ إقامته.</span></p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":null},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/ec2d3d4785ac416c91777b8a1bb241a8\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"المادة الرابعة\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">على المرخص له تضمين عقد الوساطة لتقديم خدمة المزادات العقارية - إضافةً للأحكام الواردة لعقد الوساطة المنصوص عليها في النظام واللائحة التنفيذية - المعلومات التالية: </span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">1-<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> </span></span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">طريقة إقامة المزاد العقاري</span>.</p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">2-<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> </span></span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">تاريخ إقامة المزاد العقاري ومدته –إن وجد-.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">3-<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">  </span></span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">نوع التصرف بالعقار محل المزاد العقاري.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">4-<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">  </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">الحد الأدنى لقيمة الترسية المقبولة للتصرف في العقار بعد المزايدة.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">5-<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> </span></span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">الحد الأدنى لقيمة بدء المزاد العقاري.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">6-<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> </span></span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">مبلغ الدخول في المزايدة - إن وجد –</span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">، </span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">على ألا يتجاوز المبلغ نسبة (5%) من القيمة التقديرية للعقار بناء على تقييم من مقيم معتمد.</span>، و<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">تحديد نوع المبلغ (عربون – مقدم ثمن – تأمين مسترد).</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">7-<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">  </span></span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">المدة الزمنية المحددة للترسية على السعر الأعلى بعد المزايدة وإمكانية تمديدها لمدة مماثلة مرة واحدة. </span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">8-<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">  </span></span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">آليات ومدد تسلُّم وتسليم الثمن بعد الترسية.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">9- </span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">الأحكام المتعلقة بالتصرف في العقار كحق الشفعة، وخيار المجلس، وخيار الشرط، وبيع العربون، وغير ذلك.</span></p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":null},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/b6e9fa213c2b47a3bce8ce4c654b2142\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"المادة الخامسة\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">تنشأ في المنصة الإلكترونية بالهيئة سجل المزادات العقارية، يقيد فيها الآتي:&nbsp;</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">&nbsp;</span>‌أ- </span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">سجل بيانات المرخص لهم.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">ب-</span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">بيانات كافة المزادات العقارية المنظَّمة من المرخص لهم، سواءً كانت إلكترونية أو غير إلكترونية.&nbsp;<br></span><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">ج-</span></span>نشر كافة المؤشرات الإحصائية للمزادات بشكل دوري.</p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":null},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/a1a8f4a3aa4b4898b49eed440a1ceebd\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"المادة السادسة\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">يتقدم المرخص له للهيئة بطلب إقامة المزاد العقاري في المنصة الإلكترونية للهيئة، وتعبئة النموذج المعتمد -قبل إقامته- بخمسة عشر يوماً -بحدٍ أدنى-، مرفقاً به البيانات والمتطلبات التالية: </span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">1-<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">  </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->تحديد مكان وطريقة<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> إقامة المزاد العقاري.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">2-<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">  </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->تاريخ<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> إقامة المزاد العقاري ومدته.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">3-<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">  </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->تحديد مدير المزاد العقاري التابع له.</p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">4-<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> </span></span></span>نوع التصرف بالعقار محل المزاد العقاري.</p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">5-<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> </span></span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">آليات حفظ أموال المتنافسين في المزاد العقاري.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">6-<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> </span></span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">آليات المزايدة والترسية الواردة في الفقرات (5-9) من المادة الرابعة من اللائحة.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">7-<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->تسجيل بيانات<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> العقار محل المزاد العقاري، بما يشمل الآتي:</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: right; text-indent: -63.0pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -4.5pt; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 63.0pt; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 63.0pt 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> </span>‌أ-   </span></span><!--[endif]-->بيانات مالك العقار أو مالك المنفعة.</p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: right; text-indent: -63.0pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -4.5pt; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 63.0pt; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 63.0pt 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> </span>‌ب- </span></span>البيانات المساحية والموقع، ومواصفات العقار، وحالته.</p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: right; text-indent: -63.0pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -4.5pt; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 63.0pt; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 63.0pt 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">ج- </span></span>تحديد ملكية العقار على الأصل أو المنفعة، والاشتراك أو الشيوع أو نحو ذلك.</p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: right; text-indent: -63.0pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -4.5pt; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 63.0pt; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 63.0pt 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> </span>‌د- </span></span>الإفصاح عن الحقوق العينية المرتبطة بالعقار.</p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: right; text-indent: -63.0pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -4.5pt; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 63.0pt; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 63.0pt 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> </span>‌هـ- </span></span>النزاعات القائمة بشأن العقار -إن وجدت-.</p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: right; text-indent: -63.0pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -4.5pt; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 63.0pt; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 63.0pt 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> </span>‌و- </span></span>الرهن أو القيد المؤثر في الانتفاع من العقار -إن وجد-.</p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: right; text-indent: -63.0pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -4.5pt; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 63.0pt; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 63.0pt 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> </span>ز- </span></span>الحقوق والالتزامات على العقار غير الموثقة في وثيقة العقار -إن وجدت-.</p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: right; text-indent: -63.0pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -4.5pt; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 63.0pt; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 63.0pt 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">‌ح- </span></span>الخدمات المتعلقة بالعقار -إن وجدت-.</p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: right; text-indent: -63.0pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -4.5pt; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 63.0pt; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 63.0pt 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">ط- </span></span>المعلومات التي قد تؤثر في قيمة العقار –إن وجدت-.</p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":null},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/24cf183cb8374c6f83981476a4d6388d\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"المادة السابعة\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .25in 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">1- </span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-EG\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">تدرس الهيئة طلب إقامة المزاد العقاري خلال مدة لا تتجاوز (خمسة) أيام عمل من اكتمال الطلب، و</span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">للهيئة</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .25in 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">عند الحاجة لأي بيانات أو مستندات إضافية ترى ضرورتها، إشعار مقدم الطلب وعليه استكمال ما يلزم خلال مدة لا تتجاوز (خمسة) أيام عمل من تاريخ إبلاغه بذلك، وإلا عدّ الطلب مرفوضًا</span><span>.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .25in 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">2- </span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">تصدر الهيئة الموافقة على إقامة المزاد العقاري، أو ترفضه مع ذكر مسببات الرفض وإفادة مقدم الطلب بذلك.</span></p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":null},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/91707b4583e8497abc7232dabd527ae1\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"المادة الثامنة\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">يجب أن يدرج المرخص له (نشرة المزاد العقاري) على المنصة الإلكترونية قبل نشرها للعموم، متضمنة: </span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">1- </span></span>تحديد مكان <span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">وطريقة ووقت</span> إقامة المزاد العقاري.</p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">2-</span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">بيانات العقار المساحية والموقع، ومواصفات العقار، وحالته.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">3- </span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">تحديد نوع التصرف بالعقار محل المزاد العقاري.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">4-</span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">الإفصاح عن الحقوق العينية المرتبطة بالعقار. </span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">5- </span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">النزاعات القائمة بشأن العقار -إن وجدت-. </span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">6-</span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">الرهن أو القيد المؤثر في الانتفاع من العقار -إن وجد-. </span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">7- </span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">الحقوق والالتزامات على العقار غير الموثقة في وثيقة العقار -إن وجدت-.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">8- </span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">الخدمات المتعلقة بالعقار -إن وجدت-.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">9-</span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">المعلومات التي قد تؤثر في قيمة العقار –إن وجدت-.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">10- </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">رابط النقل المرئي المباشر للمزادات –إن وجد-.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 170%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">11- </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">البيانات الواردة في الفقرة رقم (6) من المادة (السادسة) من هذه اللائحة.</span></p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":null},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/6f93e85909ce4e5faefee78e8cc05eb8\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"المادة التاسعة\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .25in 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">1- </span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">يتولى مدير المزاد العقاري إدارة المزايدة السعرية بين المتنافسين، </span>ويبدأ المزاد العقاري ‌<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">وفقاً لقيمة بدء المزاد العقاري المحددة في عقد الوساطة، ويجوز بدء المزاد بغير تلك القيمة حال إقرار المالك - أو من يمثله نظاماً –كتابة على ذلك.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .25in 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">2- </span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">إذا قدم أحد المتنافسين أعلى عطاء ولم يقم أحدٌ بالمزايدة عليه، -وفق المدة الزمنية المحددة في عقد الوساطة-، فيجوز لمدير المزاد العقاري تمديدها لمدة مماثلة مرة واحدة</span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .25in 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">3- </span></span>إذا لم يصل<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> المزاد العقاري للقيمة المتفق عليها لقبول البيع في عقد الوساطة، فيتم التعامل معها بأحد الأحوال التالية:</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 45.0pt 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">أ‌- </span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">إقرار المالك - أو من يمثله نظاماً - كتابة على قبول الترسية والتصرف في العقار بالسعر الذي وصلت له المزايدة.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 45.0pt 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">ب‌-<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> &nbsp;</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">إنهاء المزايدة في حال عدم الإقرار من المالك - أو من يمثله نظاماً -، وتحرير محضر بذلك.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .25in 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">4- </span></span>يتم ترسية<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> المزاد العقاري على المتنافس الذي قدم أعلى عطاء ولم يقم أحد بالمزايدة عليه، وانتهاء المدة المحددة للمزايدة، وفق الحالات التالية:</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 45.0pt 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">أ‌-<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">بلوغ المزايدة أو تجاوزها للقيمة المحددة لقبول الترسية والتصرف في العقار المنصوص عليها في عقد الوساطة.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 45.0pt 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">ب‌- </span></span><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">عدم بلوغ المزايدة للقيمة المحددة لقبول الترسية والتصرف في العقار المنصوص عليها في عقد الوساطة، وإقرار المالك -أو من يمثله نظاماً- كتابة على قبول الترسية والتصرف في العقار، وفقا للفقرة (3/أ) من هذه المادة.</span></p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .25in 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">5- </span></span>تستكمل<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> إجراءات التصرف في العقار، وحجز مبلغ العربون وفقا للمدة المحددة لتسلم وتسليم الثمن في عقد الوساطة.</span></p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":null},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/f7a5508aab11429fb547f8534fbba896\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"المادة العاشرة\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .25in 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-bidi-language: AR-EG;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">1-<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> </span></span></span>يجب على<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> المرخص له إقفال المزاد العقاري في المنصة الإلكترونية بعد الانتهاء من إقامته خلال مدة لا تزيد على (خمسة) أيام عمل</span>.</p>\\\\\\\\n<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 170%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in .25in 0in 0in;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt'; mso-fareast-font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">2- </span></span>يعيد المرخص<span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"> له جميع المبالغ المالية للمتنافسين المستلمة من قبله في المزاد العقاري - عدا من رسا عليه المزاد العقاري - خلال مدة لا تتجاوز (ثلاثة) أيام عمل من تاريخ الانتهاء من إقامته. </span></p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":null},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/740b50bfe26f42e9b0d6e976ad22a72a\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"المادة الحادية عشرة\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">تسري أحكام هذه اللائحة على كافة المزادات العقارية في المملكة، ومنها المزادات العقارية القضائية وما في حكمها في حدود ما لم يرد فيه نص خاص لتنظيمها.</span></p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":null},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/6a8ca639b080441a8d687f531c5bf30f\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"المادة الثانية عشرة\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 150%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed;\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" dir=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"RTL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"MsoNormal\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"font-family: '29LT Bukra Lt';\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" lang=\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"AR-SA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\">تُنشر هذه اللائحة في الجريدة الرسمية، ويُعمل بها من تاريخ نشرها.</span></p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":null},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/e6aa439b118347978c8cc28399260ba7\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"أحكام الترخيص\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":\\\"1\\\"},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/774dc0d992de4eb0aa9558a78f556fb4\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"التزامات المرخص له\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":\\\"1\\\"},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/4fa171b16b7e4ef58d430095c098badb\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"المنصة الإلكترونية\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":null},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/3b5fd9c8f8054d9fa92436c3a5566e89\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"أحكام إقامة المزاد العقاري\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":\\\"1\\\"},{\\\"contentTypeKey\\\":\\\"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\\\",\\\"udi\\\":\\\"umb://element/31e11ad366984ce5ac5a900f7a54eec9\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"أحكام ختامية\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"markup\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"blocks\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"contentData\\\\\\\":[],\\\\\\\"settingsData\\\\\\\":[]}}\\\",\\\"header\\\":\\\"1\\\"}],\\\"settingsData\\\":[]}\"","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"description","path":"Property/description","oldValue":"null","newValue":"\"اللائحة التنظيمية للمزادات العقارية\"","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"keywords","path":"Property/keywords","oldValue":"null","newValue":"\"[\\n  \\\"اللائحة التنظيمية للمزادات العقارية\\\",\\n  \\\"المزاد\\\",\\n  \\\"المزادات العقارية\\\",\\n  \\\"لوائح\\\",\\n  \\\"الانظمة\\\",\\n  \\\"الانظمة واللوائح والادلة\\\",\\n  \\\"الهيئة العامة للعقار\\\"\\n]\"","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"pageName","path":"Property/pageName","oldValue":"null","newValue":"\"اللائحة التنظيمية للمزادات العقارية\"","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"socialMediaImage","path":"Property/socialMediaImage","oldValue":"null","newValue":"\"umb://media/ba6d866b399d4d158df62ecef4617b90\"","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"title","path":"Property/title","oldValue":"null","newValue":"\"اللائحة التنظيمية للمزادات العقارية\"","change":"Update"}],"key":"0242b700-ad86-4dba-a812-c5eb6f7f9b61"},{"handlerAlias":"PublishedContentHandler","success":true,"itemType":"IContent","message":"Published","exception":null,"change":"Import","fileName":"umbraco/Data/TEMP/uSync/rec